        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("Fort Elenssse burns, gone forever! My hatchplace is free and my people can return to live here again. Sssaurian Empire will lassst thirteen millennia more!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Learn from this victory, Resha. See now the futility of your doubt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Gorlack, by this victory my doubt rises threefold. We have flown headlong into chaos, into the innermost whirlwind of the Winds of Fate. Though our Windpath is now unknowable, I fear it leads to war."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("There can be no <i>war</i> in a land with prey so plenty."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("These creatures are more than prey. They could very well outmatch us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("... You witnessed only moments ago how we slew a nest of them utterly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Perhaps... your patrols have been overtaxing, Resha. I relieve you of all duties. Return to the eyrie until your sense recovers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Arinexis",
            text: _("With these humans dead, ssspiritsss of my brood sssisssters feel sssome peace... but humans were only hirelings for elves, yesssss, elves mussst ssstill pay... Elves of Wesssmere, your time has come!"),
          },
        ],
      },
